Package: xli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: command line tool for viewing images in X11
 xli can view the following image types under X11: 
  Portable Network Graphics (PNG)
  GIF Images
  JFIF style jpeg Images
  WEBP Images
  Targa Images (TGA)
  BMP Images Windows, OS/2
  Portable Bit Map (PNM, PBM, PGM, PPM)
  PC Paintbrush Images (PCX)
  X Pixmap XPM
  X Bitmap XBM
  X Window Dump XWD
  Tag Images File Format (TIFF)
  Sun Rasterfile RAS
  CMU WM Raster
  Facesaver Project (FS)
  G3 FAX Images
  FBM Images
  Utah RLE Images (RLE)
  GEM Images (IMG)
  MacPaint Images
  